      "mechanicKey": "designated_seek",
      "currentConsumption": "Player.updateWeapon/fireWeapon → Projectiles.spawn/_step 或 fireBeam → Game.onDamage/explode → Enemy.takeDamage/applyStatus；Attachment.attachMods在发射处合成。",
